{"speciesId":696,"names":{"fr":"Ptyranidur","es":"Tyrunt","en":"Tyrunt","ja":"チゴラス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ramené à la vie à partir d’un fossile, ce Pokémon très capricieux devient violent à la moindre contrariété."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Pokémon recreado a partir de fósiles. Cuando sucede algo que no es de su agrado, se enfurece y se vuelve violento."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"This Pokémon was restored from a fossil. If something happens that it doesn’t like, it throws a tantrum and runs wild."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"化石から 復活した ポケモン。 気に入らない ことが あると かんしゃくを 起こして 大暴れ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses énormes mâchoires ont tant de puissance qu’elles peuvent compresser une voiture sans problème. Ce Pokémon vivait il y a 100 millions d’années."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Su gran mandíbula posee una potencia tan atroz que sería capaz de destruir a bocados un coche. Ya vivía hace la friolera de 100 millones de años."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its immense jaws have enough destructive force that it can chew up an automobile. It lived 100 million years ago."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"自動車を バリバリと かじって 壊す おおあごの 破壊力。 １億年前に 生息していた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ramené à la vie à partir d’un fossile, ce Pokémon très capricieux devient violent à la moindre contrariété."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Pokémon recreado a partir de fósiles. Cuando sucede algo que no es de su agrado, se enfurece y se vuelve violento."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"This Pokémon was restored from a fossil. If something happens that it doesn’t like, it throws a tantrum and runs wild."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"化石から 復活した ポケモン。 気に入らない ことが あると かんしゃくを 起こして 大暴れ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ses énormes mâchoires ont tant de puissance qu’elles peuvent compresser une voiture sans problème. Ce Pokémon vivait il y a 100 millions d’années."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Su gran mandíbula posee una potencia tan atroz que sería capaz de destruir a bocados un coche. Ya vivía hace la friolera de 100 millones de años."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Its immense jaws have enough destructive force that it can chew up an automobile. It lived 100 million years ago."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"自動車を バリバリと かじって 壊す おおあごの 破壊力。 １億年前に 生息していた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Sa mâchoire géante est d’une puissance redoutable. Le Pokémon reconstitué serait légèrement différent de son modèle antique."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Puede ejercer una enorme presión con su gran mandíbula. Se cree que esta especie regenerada a partir de un fósil difiere de la de tiempo ha."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its large jaw has incredible destructive power. Some theories suggest that its restored form is different from its form of long ago."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"大アゴは 凄まじい 破壊力。 復元させても 当時と 同じ 姿では ないという 説もある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il est un peu égoïste et aime être le centre d’attention. Il arrive que ses partenaires de jeu finissent avec de graves blessures."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Un tanto egoísta y malcriado. Aunque solo esté bromeando, a veces puede causar graves heridas a sus compañeros de juegos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Tyrunt is spoiled and selfish. It may just be trying to frolic, but sometimes the ones it’s trying to frolic with are gravely injured."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"甘えんぼうで わがまま。 チゴラスは じゃれているつもりでも 相手は 大怪我では 済まないことも ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon ancien a été ranimé à partir d’un fossile. Égoïste et violent, il peut détruire n’importe quoi avec son énorme mâchoire."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Pokémon prehistórico recreado a partir de un fósil. De carácter violento y egoísta, sus enormes mandíbulas pueden triturar cualquier cosa."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This is an ancient Pokémon, revived in modern times. It has a violent disposition, and it’ll tear apart anything it gets between its hefty jaws."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"蘇った 古代の ポケモン。 気性は 荒く 身勝手。 大顎で なんでも かみ砕く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Capricieux, il veut toujours être le centre de l’attention. Il peut gravement blesser son Dresseur en essayant de jouer avec lui."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Un Pokémon un tanto egoísta y malcriado. Puede ocasionar graves lesiones a su Entrenador incluso jugando."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon is selfish and likes to be pampered. It can also inflict grievous wounds on its Trainer just by playing around."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"わがままだが 甘えん坊。 じゃれてるだけで トレーナーに 大けがを 負わせてしまう。"}],"varieties":[{"id":696,"moves":[{"name":"stomp","learns":[[15,"level-up",10],[16,"level-up",10],[17,"level-up",10],[18,"level-up",10],[20,"level-up",24]]},{"name":"horn-drill","learns":[[15,"level-up",49],[16,"level-up",49],[17,"level-up",49],[18,"level-up",49],[20,"level-up",48]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[15,"level-up",40],[16,"level-up",40],[17,"level-up",40],[18,"level-up",40],[20,"level-up",40]]},{"name":"tail-whip","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[15,"level-up",17],[16,"level-up",17],[17,"level-up",17],[18,"level-up",17],[20,"level-up",16]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[15,"level-up",6],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",6],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",6],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",6]